  "description": "Lightweight, nimble and born for modern life. The Skwad LT features a minimalist, compact frame design that makes it the perfect E-bike for travel. Pedal-assist with a 250 Watt motor and a slim, in-tube UL Certified battery for a low center of gravity and improved stability. 20-inch wheels allow it to easily tuck into smaller spaces when it's time to load it up or park it. The Rider's App is your personal connection to the bike, with a wide range of features including a navigation system that coordinates battery capacity in regards to routes, as well as bike status, weather alerts, diagnostics and more. Outfit your Skwad LT with an assortment of baskets, crates and bags using the built-in, compatible AtranVeloSystem (AVS) mounts. Good to go--everywhere.",
